WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
[Your subtitles. On your video. Subtitle Overlay for Chrome]

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.700
[Bring your subtitles. Load a subtitle file.]

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.200
[Find the right file. Search by title and language.]

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.700
[Pick up where you left off. Reopen saved subtitles.]

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.400
[Make it yours. Change the look and position.]

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.400
[Find your timing. Nudge or reset the offset.]

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.400
[Find a line. Jump there. Search inside your subtitles.]

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.900
The package arrived this morning and nobody signed for it.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.700
[Keep watching. Subtitles in fullscreen.]

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.500
[Stay in control. Your defaults and shortcuts.]

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
[Review the Smart Sync fit. Optional Pro · Apply or Undo.]

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Watch at your own pace. Find Subtitle Overlay on the Chrome Web Store.]
